{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/1de257b544d94602f157edabe5413e93.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/1de257b544d94602f157edabe5413e93.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/1de257b544d94602f157edabe5413e93.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative horror for up to 4 players, mixing the traditions of classic survival horror with modern co-op mechanics. Complete the Quota, fight the creatures birthed by City of Mist, and build your own powerful loadout using unique artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/98d2c163973901c1b76448f54db2bad8.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1489 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City of Mist is always changing. Procedural generation makes each visit unique, with system of random events and varied scenarios, every playthrough will feel different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/ea7476145803217fff6cc143fd3fe36a.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/ea7476145803217fff6cc143fd3fe36a.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/ea7476145803217fff6cc143fd3fe36a.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/e3534424b374459b8526340241abbafc.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1489 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We draw our inspiration from old-school horrors to recreate the eerie atmosphere, reimagined for a modern era. A deep melee-focused combat system let you choose your style: fast slashes or heavy, crushing attacks. For those who prefer to strike from a distance, firearms can turn any battle into a blood bath, if you have the ammo\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/cc0f320e2d5599c766d71a32b1eaeaad.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/cc0f320e2d5599c766d71a32b1eaeaad.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/cc0f320e2d5599c766d71a32b1eaeaad.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/4f4484b72700a88edd0544385e095ef5.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1489 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the City, gather items and artifacts filled with emotional traces to complete the demonic Quota, and survive a little longer, even at the cost of life of others. Build and customize unique loadouts by combining various artifacts with powerful effects and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f1da6dd128a9683bb4e093ffa8173dfb.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f1da6dd128a9683bb4e093ffa8173dfb.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f1da6dd128a9683bb4e093ffa8173dfb.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/368aeaf4ceb175c55a70d766aa170a72.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Postwar 1920s-inspired style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced melee combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural generation of City and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PSX-style graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique artifacts</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620240?t=1770044665","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/654e7721ceb49495af71d37c3ac132c3edd2c369/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770044665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/a2386e2cfa26e88910f78ce9405594c372657921/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770044665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/a2386e2cfa26e88910f78ce9405594c372657921/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770044665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Game contains violence, gore and general mature content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/1de257b544d94602f157edabe5413e93.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/1de257b544d94602f157edabe5413e93.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/1de257b544d94602f157edabe5413e93.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative horror for up to 4 players, mixing the traditions of classic survival horror with modern co-op mechanics. Complete the Quota, fight the creatures birthed by City of Mist, and build your own powerful loadout using unique artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/98d2c163973901c1b76448f54db2bad8.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1489 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City of Mist is always changing. Procedural generation makes each visit unique, with system of random events and varied scenarios, every playthrough will feel different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/ea7476145803217fff6cc143fd3fe36a.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/ea7476145803217fff6cc143fd3fe36a.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/ea7476145803217fff6cc143fd3fe36a.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/e3534424b374459b8526340241abbafc.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1489 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We draw our inspiration from old-school horrors to recreate the eerie atmosphere, reimagined for a modern era. A deep melee-focused combat system let you choose your style: fast slashes or heavy, crushing attacks. For those who prefer to strike from a distance, firearms can turn any battle into a blood bath, if you have the ammo\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/cc0f320e2d5599c766d71a32b1eaeaad.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/cc0f320e2d5599c766d71a32b1eaeaad.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/cc0f320e2d5599c766d71a32b1eaeaad.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/4f4484b72700a88edd0544385e095ef5.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1489 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the City, gather items and artifacts filled with emotional traces to complete the demonic Quota, and survive a little longer, even at the cost of life of others. Build and customize unique loadouts by combining various artifacts with powerful effects and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f1da6dd128a9683bb4e093ffa8173dfb.poster.avif?t=1770044665\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f1da6dd128a9683bb4e093ffa8173dfb.webm?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f1da6dd128a9683bb4e093ffa8173dfb.mp4?t=1770044665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/368aeaf4ceb175c55a70d766aa170a72.avif?t=1770044665\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Postwar 1920s-inspired style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced melee combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pr